<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>No need to change weapon yourself.</Major>
    <Description>Quick switch that will automate 3 1 or 3 Q process for you.
Useful in shotguns, preferably slayer shotgun. Good with speed titles and first shot accuracy titles.
Normal human reaction time is above 200ms while this program can help you switch in 10ms.

Resolution is 1920x1080 tested with 60 fps.
Use with run once per click or loop mode. it works best using once per click though.
Good luck and have fun!
</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 450 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyDown 32 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 32 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyDown 30 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 30 1
GoColor 1 0 255,255,255 255,255,255 2 1920 1080 1 1 1 0
MoveR 0 15
varE = 0</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Point blank</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>